hands-free mode.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.540a9d7be41a4cdf\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"claim\": \"The unified-agent.ts file processes user queries using function calling to determine if a tool should be used, with fallback to text generation for providers without tool support.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.f067d079c72e3884\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"heading\": \"Jarvis.ceo Task Architecture and Open-Source Integration\",\n        \"source_id\": \"S1\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"facts\": [\n          {\n            \"claim\": \"The AgentManager class in agent-manager.ts initializes the agent with support for Ollama, with plans to add OpenAI and Gemini providers in the future.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.a220ed7fd7d2c0d8\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"claim\": \"The unified-agent.ts file logs detailed information about the provider and tools used, including the initialization of the agent and processing of user queries.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.a220ed7fd7d2c0d8\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"claim\": \"The OpenJarvis/native_react.py file includes functionality for handling text and message processing, with support for features like text stripping and message insertion.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.a220ed7fd7d2c0d8\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"heading\": \"Code Implementation and Integration\",\n        \"source_id\": \"S2\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"facts\": [\n          {\n            \"claim\": \"Date.now() is used in the unified-agent.ts file to track the start time of query processing, enabling performance tracking.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.871ee2b54f993e3d\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"claim\": \"Logger.info() is used extensively in the unified-agent.ts file to log information about the agent's operations, including initialization and query processing.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.f01f2b05203a653b\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"claim\": \"Logger.info() is also used in the unified-agent.ts file to log information about the agent's operations, including initialization and query processing.\",\n            \"evidence_id\": \"N3.ff77fbd51b03f00f\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"heading\": \"Logging and Performance Tracking\",\n        \"source_id\": \"S3\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"title\": \"Jarvis.ceo Task Architecture and Open-Source Integration\"\n  }\n}","role":"assistant"},"model":"qwen3-8b-uncensored","prompt_eval_count":8941,"prompt_eval_duration":1764795000,"total_duration":10265685100},"raw_envelope":{"action":"ultima_work_research_write","action_input":{"path":"research.md","sections":[{"facts":[{"claim":"Jarvis.ceo supports local LLMs via Ollama, allowing users to run models like LFM2 and Llama 3 locally for fast, private processing.","evidence_id":"N3.260f42e2b8c3e702"},{"claim":"Jarvis.ceo provides keyboard shortcuts for voice dictation, such as holding `Fn` to start/stop recording and double-tapping `Fn` to toggle hands-free mode.","evidence_id":"N3.540a9d7be41a4cdf"},{"claim":"The unified-agent.ts file processes user queries using function calling to determine if a tool should be used, with fallback to text generation for providers without tool support.","evidence_id":"N3.f067d079c72e3884"}],"heading":"Jarvis.ceo Task Architecture and Open-Source Integration","source_id":"S1"},{"facts":[{"claim":"The AgentManager class in agent-manager.ts initializes the agent with support for Ollama, with plans to add OpenAI and Gemini providers in the future.","evidence_id":"N3.a220ed7fd7d2c0d8"},{"claim":"The unified-agent.ts file logs detailed information about the provider and tools used, including the initialization of the agent and processing of user queries.","evidence_id":"N3.a220ed7fd7d2c0d8"},{"claim":"The OpenJarvis/native_react.py file includes functionality for handling text and message processing, with support for features like text stripping 